    <!-- Additional Localized Strings -->
    <string name="privacy_policy_content">T-Emulator respects your privacy.\n\n• Offline Gaming: Free, requires no account, and keeps all game ROM files, save progress, and settings entirely local on your device.\n• Optional Google Sign-In &amp; VIP Billing: Used to verify VIP entitlement with our secure verification server and link your purchase to your account.\n• Google Drive Backup (VIP): ROM and save files are uploaded directly to your personal Google Drive (T-Emulator Backups folder). We do not collect, store, or sell your game files.\n• Data Control: You can delete your app account session and server entitlement records anytime from More &gt; Delete App Account.</string>
